 - 2026-06-11: DECENTRALIZATION stronger-base -- COLLECT+VALIDATE (G3): poll the backgrounded run from exp4036; report whether the stronger local base's best-of-N demo-perfect coverage rises above exp4012's 0.2581 (gemma-4-12B) ceiling. Diagnose: coverage rises materially (CI excludes the 0.2581 baseline) -> the abstraction is LATENT in the larger local model -> distillation/RLVR viable, the sovereign path scales with base size; coverage stays flat -> the abstraction is ABSENT (the Invisible Leash holds) -> sovereignty needs a still-stronger base, not more training. Report the cost (local seconds vs codex 46s/task; the model-free verifier is ~free). Honest negative is a COMPLETE verdict. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: decentralization_stronger_base_partial_0_tasks; results/experiment_4037_decentralization_stronger_base.json
 - 2026-06-11: SEVENTH ARC-AGI-3 game first-solve via the PROVEN explore-first method (raises games-solved 6->7; monotonic +1 per the Incremental-Progress rule): exp4024 solved the 6th game (cd82). Apply the proven loop -- (1) active exploration OBSERVES transitions, (2) induce mechanic + goal predicate from OBSERVED transitions, (3) GAP-4 verifier validates the rule, (4) act -- to a NEW non-spatial-planning game from the win-condition survey not yet solved. Honest no-solve is a COMPLETE verdict. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: seventh_game_solved_dc22-fdcac232_at_action_20; results/experiment_4038_seventh_game_explore_first.json
 - 2026-06-11: ArcMemo v6: concept-LIBRARY learning (self-learning MANDATE; extends the exp4025 v5 71->21-action transfer): v5 stored raw concepts; v6 COMPRESSES recurring induced-program fragments into NAMED, documented abstractions (LILO/Stitch, arXiv:2310.19791) that seed future induction. Measure whether the compressed library makes THIS milestone's new solves (exp4035 search-layer / exp4038 7th game) cheaper (fewer actions / fewer induction calls) than v5's raw memory and a cold start. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: arcmemo_v6_library_transfer_59to18_actions; results/experiment_4039_arcmemo_concept_library_v6.json
+- 2026-06-11: Hardware continuity (consolidated; KV260 drive-toward-terminal per north-star §3): per-board SSH/USB reachability + KV260 toward its terminal state. exp4027 found KV260 reachable but the carnot_ising OVERLAY ABSENT -- this task loads it (xmutil loadapp) and takes a board-latency-transcript step (the KV260 terminal-state gate). GateMate (openFPGALoader -c dirtyJtag --detect) + PolarFire (ssh polarfire) opportunistic. Per KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline: SSH-reachability is the ONLY valid KV260 precondition. DISTINCT wall-clock timers per board (no shared-timestamp tautology). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_kv260_overlay_loaded_latency_step_blocked_4040_gmblocked_gatemate_unreachable_pfreachable_ssh_continuity_recorded; results/experiment_4040_hardware_continuity.json
